                                "example_id": "eb51feaf-3d1d-4c13-a858-d3db715a6a09",
                                "sense_id": "b34b2053-8e2b-32be-87af-164fd19bbce9",
                                "text": "Never did a misdemeanist take his “six weeks” with a more complete consciousness of penalty than did Polly sit down to that piano. She well understood it as a sentence, and, let me own, submitted well and gracefully to her fate."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ea0c2ee1-9955-49ab-8981-b095c9a9244f",
                                "sense_id": "b34b2053-8e2b-32be-87af-164fd19bbce9",
                                "text": "Courts have held in many instances that it is better to allow a misdemeanist to escape rather than take his life."
                            }
